   "name": "HEADER",
   "parameters": {
    "content": "# NZAMY · Admin & Moderation\n\n• **5.1** Daily digest (cron 8am) ✅ Supabase getAll requests → count by status → DUMMY to admin\n• **5.2** Security alert (`/auth-failed`) ✅ compose alert → DUMMY (app must POST failed-login events)\n• **5.3** Moderation (`/new-post`) ✅ keyword pre-filter → DUMMY (add LLM node for nuance)\n\nSupabase cred `nzamy`. Delivery = DUMMY until Evolution/email wired.",
